                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16805108" author="sdarlington" created="Fri, 29 Mar 2019 15:31:21 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I added the check for OpenSSL as part of the Mac port: &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1436&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1436&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16821181" author="isapego" created="Thu, 18 Apr 2019 14:48:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sdarlington&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sdarlington&quot;&gt;sdarlington&lt;/a&gt; thank you for the patch. Can you also add &lt;tt&gt;OPENSSL_HOME&lt;/tt&gt; note as proposed in the ticket description?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16849706" author="sdarlington" created="Tue, 28 May 2019 13:12:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Done. Also rebased (again) and added references to &lt;tt&gt;--with-openssl&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;option (which is probably better than using environment variable).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16946901" author="mmuzaf" created="Tue, 8 Oct 2019 13:50:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sdarlington&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sdarlington&quot;&gt;sdarlington&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=isapego&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;isapego&quot;&gt;isapego&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Folks, any updates here? Can we proceed with this patch?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
